<DocsExample TExample="SupportingPaneViewAutoExample" Title="Primary with supporting content" Description="NTSupportingPaneView shows one primary pane and a secondary pane of related context. In Auto mode the panes stack when narrow and sit side by side when wide. FullHeight makes each pane scroll inside the bounded box used here." />
<DocsExample TExample="SupportingPaneViewStackedExample" Title="Stacked mode" Description="Mode=Stacked keeps the supporting pane below the primary pane at every width." />
<DocsExample TExample="SupportingPaneViewHideExample" Title="Hide on small screens" Description="Mode=HideOnSmallScreens hides the supporting pane below 840px, so the primary pane must stand on its own." />
